BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76d3f641-3a58-3202-8cba-c5a8ba7e6dc9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
